    "Details": "After the formal signing of the Trinity Alliance in 3062, both Majesty Metals and Detroit Consolidated Mech Works opened their own Talos production lines, developing multiple variants of the Talos for their own use and for export further afield. The 5A carries an exceptionally heavy artillery-support loadout for a medium 'Mech, sporting paired Sniper Cannons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
